    <string name="info_type">Counter workouts track reps and increase your target as you check in. Timer Only workouts use the same timer without counting reps. Checking in still keeps your streak. You can switch between the two without losing your settings or history.</string>

    <string name="info_voice">At the start of each work set, says the number of reps to do. For Timer Only workouts, it says the set number instead.</string>

